{"id":"n70702-1-9","stage":1,"title":"간단하다 · 简单","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70702-1-9-1","ko":"나는 왜 자꾸 살이 찌는 걸까?","zh":"我为什么总是越来越胖呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}},{"text":"살이","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살이","audio":"/audio/10d950f9fb857268bb30.mp3"}},{"text":"찌는","meaning":"发胖，长膘","explanation":"찌다：发胖，长膘；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌는","audio":"/audio/bfdaf51b445dbea8a0d6.mp3"}},{"text":"걸까?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸까","audio":"/audio/992653d41a01574791b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的身体中包裹着骨头的柔软部分。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"发胖，长膘","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"62375","definition":"身上长肉变胖。","pronunciation":["찌다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e7129f68d17a7550d29.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70702-1-9-2","ko":"이유는 간단해. 네가 먹기만 하고 운동을 안 해서야.","zh":"原因很简单，因为你光知道吃，却不运动。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이유는","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유는","audio":"/audio/6a15e669aed8fb094a64.mp3"}},{"text":"간단해.","meaning":"简单，简短，简洁","explanation":"간단하다：简单，简短，简洁；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"간단하다","audio":"/audio/f6dc36bb270a1ad55beb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70702","senseId":"1","lemma":"간단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간단해","audio":"/audio/8ef29a2ad4198b5cbefd.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"먹기만","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹기만","audio":"/audio/3c9ad32c4f28fbac6fe5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做；먹기만 하다 指只顾吃","explanation":"하다：做；먹기만 하다 指只顾吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"해서야.","meaning":"做、进行（운동을 하다：锻炼）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（운동을 하다：锻炼）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해서야","audio":"/audio/25529a79d34326822a3b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发